# DrumMania 10th Mix: a game, from what drmn10m-boot left (its NVRAM: no NOTE 605 now). The boot
# checks and the multi-session unit's link, the title by frame ~8400; two coins, then Start every
# 300 frames through the mode select (STANDARD) and the music select (its default, 花火); the first
# stage plays with no input, so it ends in GAME OVER, and attract shows 花火 on the hit chart. The
# music is the digital board's MP3. Beyond MAME, which stops at "Please call attendant".
game drmn10m

at 9000 press "Coin 1" 8
at 9040 press "Coin 1" 8
from 9200 every 300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 0 every 300 snap
at 13000 quit
